      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所以只要称霸「朝日杯FS」与「樱花赏」，\n我不管在哪条路线都是英里王了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd6f9c83564fda220ca57eb684950389def6df59a6ba548321b1d73d676a34c7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
