    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ad4391f4f1d5df023a653e8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我的目标是证明英里最强！\n这是我想称霸三赛距的目的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1805a43006aba0d960eacc1a76750747ae7d6bcd673ce3ba3a6b69ab903249b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1131/storytimeline_501131303.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        27,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/27/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebd8b7ccad9041b3eb66db88",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "咦！……是、是这样没错啦……",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c5cdbcd485ab9c988da3b6064556a86464b66d8f9428c5ab061a8d5db9e95b3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1131/storytimeline_501131303.json",
