    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc08d4ac24a3bfa1e6d4ff23",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "参加「朝日杯FS」的话，\n或许也能提前打败\n未来的经典三冠赛马娘不是吗♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f16578255f2613895ddba87c91e3b5b5668d48931b3f5e20f542c998f0a29d1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1131/storytimeline_501131303.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae2ce09de0864969b7308c52",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……这种事我连想都没想过，\n她居然要去争取真正意义上的最强。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8bef9c85c6e233f6d794ffec8009f487115cc13fe21984f30d7140a57007d5a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1131/storytimeline_501131303.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        29,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/29/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4faee17a51085188bdeab009",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "放声欢呼的表现，\n引起观众一阵骚动，这是理所当然的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "83401d28da47abbce26a36118fc716f6eddc69b708f87e754ffb4bce5bf06c5c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1131/storytimeline_501131303.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c22b8f5fd9d79cc151f6f4ea",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "且在她还是新马级的现在就要行动……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "789198af1188f3664a7f9b1f274701e1404f2aa8786cc8e380f84105ccb6a5fc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1131/storytimeline_501131303.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        30,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/30/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0ed7fde93b47b2e9cb40c7a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──可是如果是她的话，这并非不可能。\n问题是……",
      "source_fingerprint": "76662b9d1a4b70408c3ad9bbe1b79304a9ac5ab7c97a81cdcf68468bd93f46c0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1131/storytimeline_501131303.json",
      "json_path": [
