      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而且不只快，比赛直觉也非常敏锐！\n放声欢呼……\n她蕴藏着惊人的潜力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "57af90b710f254563b95e847025517774931dd8ac39daac1ce753e48c5b5f675",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1131/storytimeline_501131303.json",
      "json_path": [
