    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3453729f75c31f8582b58c5a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我该怎么指导，\n实力早已超越新马级水准的她呢──",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e3cf05d255f9e86b4c8cda62ee2b0e102cffd62ad570340af9a521b691c914b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1131/storytimeline_501131303.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        35,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/35/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95830792477fe16af7e434df",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但不能因为我的错误选择，\n而断送放声欢呼的可能性……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac06067fd343ac633178f689cb0559a0831a65e97030a33ef1327f9d2b6637a3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1131/storytimeline_501131303.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        36,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/36/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc8defe3274d2cfcfad1e022",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我知道了，接下来就跑「朝日杯FS」吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a9c034c88d3436a67fd08fcc221d9c0ccbdab0dd0ebe94b01c8012c21cdf2f5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1131/storytimeline_501131303.json",
